## 3. Registration flow

The registration page should be very simple.

### Step 1 — Sign in

Recommended options:

```text
Continue with Discord
Continue with Google
```

Discord is better for a community Minecraft server because you can identify members and send announcements later.

### Step 2 — Enter Minecraft username

```text
Minecraft Java Username
[ kaikub____________ ]

Username must be 3–16 characters.
Letters, numbers, and underscores only.
```

Also include:

* Minecraft Java Edition only notice
* Checkbox confirming the username belongs to them
* Server rules agreement
* Register button

### Step 3 — Registration status

After submission:

```text
Registration received

Minecraft username: kaikub
Status: Waiting for approval

You will be able to join after an admin approves your request.
```

Or for automatic approval:

```text
You are now whitelisted!

Server IP: mc.ratchaphon.com
Version: Minecraft Java 1.21.4

[ Copy Server IP ]
```

