## 5. Registration dashboard

After logging in, players should see:

```text
Welcome, Kaikub

Minecraft account
kaikub

Whitelist status
● Active

Server
● Online
6 / 30 players

[ Copy Server IP ]
[ Open Discord ]
```

Useful status values:

* Not registered
* Pending approval
* Approved
* Active
* Rejected
* Removed
* Banned

Also allow the player to request a username change, but do not let them change it freely without removing the old username from the whitelist.

