## 7. Live server status

A status widget makes the website feel active.

```text
Server Status

● Online
6 / 30 players
Version 1.21.4
Latency 42 ms
```

Optionally display online player names, but let players hide themselves for privacy.

You can update this using a Minecraft server status query without exposing RCON.

