## 10. Admin dashboard

This page should require an admin role.

### Whitelist requests

| Player    | Discord   |     Submitted | Status  | Action           |
| --------- | --------- | ------------: | ------- | ---------------- |
| kaikub    | @kaikub   | 2 minutes ago | Pending | Approve / Reject |
| Bookdodo5 | @bookdodo |    1 hour ago | Active  | Remove           |

Admin actions:

* Approve registration
* Reject registration
* Add whitelist manually
* Remove from whitelist
* View RCON result
* Retry failed command
* Add admin notes
* Search players
* View registration history

### Confirmation dialog

Before removing someone:

```text
Remove “kaikub” from the whitelist?

The player will no longer be able to join the server.

[ Cancel ] [ Remove Player ]
```

