## 11. Audit log

This is important because the system controls server access.

```text
Activity Log

23:41 — Admin kaikub approved Bookdodo5
23:40 — Whitelist command completed successfully
22:18 — User Somchai submitted a registration
21:55 — Admin kaikub removed TestPlayer
```

Record:

* Who performed the action
* Minecraft username
* Time
* Previous status
* New status
* RCON result

