## 12. Error states

Design these before coding.

### Invalid username

```text
This Minecraft username is invalid.
Use 3–16 letters, numbers, or underscores.
```

### Already registered

```text
This Minecraft username is already registered.
Contact an admin if this account belongs to you.
```

### Server worker offline

```text
Your registration was approved, but the server has not processed it yet.
It will be applied when the server reconnects.
```

### Minecraft server offline

```text
The server is currently offline.
Your whitelist registration is still saved.
```

