# Recommended visual style

For your server, I would use a **modern Minecraft dashboard style**, rather than copying Minecraft’s entire blocky interface.

### Style direction

* Dark green or deep navy background
* Grass-green accent color
* Off-white cards
* Pixel-art icons
* Slightly squared buttons
* Minecraft landscape screenshots
* Modern readable fonts for body text
* Pixel font only for headings

Avoid using pixel fonts for paragraphs because they become difficult to read.

### Example palette

```text
Background:     #0F1712
Card:           #18231C
Primary green:  #55C667
Light green:    #A6E3A1
Text:           #F4F7F4
Secondary text: #AAB8AD
Error:          #EF6262
Warning:        #F0B95D
```

